{ dg-modules "rcprelude" }
{ Rosetta Code, task "Increment a numerical string", ALGOL 68 solution increment-a-numerical-string.alg.
  https://rosettacode.org/wiki/Increment_a_numerical_string#ALGOL_68
  The text of Rosetta Code is available under the GNU Free Documentation
  License 1.3 (see README.md).  The solution is unchanged in orig/increment-a-numerical-string.a68;
  this copy was prepared for ga68 and converted to SUPPER stropping by
  tools/rosetta_prep.py. }
access Rc_Prelude (
string s := "12345"; file f; int i;
associate(f, s); get(f,i);
i+:=1;
s:=""; reset(f); put(f,i);
print((s, new_line))
)
